<title>CHILE: TelexChile first-half net falls.</title>
<headline>TelexChile first-half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long-distance telecom company TelexChile SA reported the following results in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>				 H1 1997	    H1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit			3.16		 6.74</p>
<p>Operating profit		1.60		 3.66</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  1.59		 3.32</p>
<p>Total sales		    30.37		27.91</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
